        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In selected classifications and locations, where business needs exist, Compensated Availability will be established.",
            "block_bbox": [
                177,
                455,
                929,
                513
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    177.0,
                    455.0
                ],
                [
                    929.0,
                    455.0
                ],
                [
                    929.0,
                    513.0
                ],
                [
                    177.0,
                    513.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. The election to participate in Compensated Availability will normally be voluntary on the part of the employee. However, where business needs exist, management may assign an employee(s) to Compensated Availability.",
            "block_bbox": [
                178,
                538,
                1044,
                650
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    178.0,
                    538.0
                ],
                [
                    1044.0,
                    538.0
                ],
                [
                    1044.0,
                    650.0
                ],
                [
                    178.0,
                    650.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. Compensated Availability may be utilized for after-hours call-outs involving critical or emergency services. Compensated Availability may also be offered to cover anticipated high activity levels. Employees on after-hours Compensated Availability shall be excused from normal overtime assignments. An employee who is unable to complete a regularly scheduled tour because the employee did not obtain sufficient rest the previous night due to working on \"compensated availability\" will not have such failure to complete a regularly scheduled tour held against them in any way.",
            "block_bbox": [
                172,
                678,
                1051,
                932
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    172.0,
                    678.0
                ],
                [
                    1051.0,
                    678.0
                ],
                [
                    1051.0,
                    932.0
                ],
                [
                    172.0,
                    932.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Such \"Compensated Availability\" shall be rotated among those qualified employees in the selected classifications and locations by seniority with volunteers and if assigned the selection of the rotated assignments shall be by inverse seniority recognizing previous volunteer assignments in the rotation. This rotation shall begin and end with each calendar year. The Compensated Availability schedule shall be posted in the appropriate location and reporting center.",
            "block_bbox": [
                170,
                955,
                1056,
                1153
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    170.0,
                    955.0
                ],
                [
                    1056.0,
                    955.0
                ],
                [
                    1056.0,
                    1153.0
                ],
                [
                    170.0,
                    1153.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. Compensation shall be $125.00 for a calendar week assignment (week assignments will include Saturday and Sunday of the same weekend). Single assignments shall be compensated at $15.00 per day and $25.00 per non-scheduled day.",
            "block_bbox": [
                168,
                1175,
                1047,
                1291
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
